  triage:title "Always Release build, no framework override" ;
  triage:description "materialize_dotnet_project() runs `dotnet build <csproj> -c Release` (Release hardcoded). There is no flag to select Debug or a custom framework. The phase-d architecture and docs require Release for the d.4 and d.5 host gate and tests, but no user-facing option is present for a developer building locally or in a different environment. This is acceptable if documented in the README as a known constraint; currently it is not surfaced." ;
